  "claim": "English actor Gary Oldman starred in the 1995 American romantic drama film made by Cinergi Pictures. A member of the Brat Pack and Robert Duvall also appeared in this film.",
  "evidencia": "Page: The Scarlet Letter (1995 film). Sentence: The Scarlet Letter is a 1995 American romantic drama film.\nPage: The Scarlet Letter (1995 film). Sentence: It was directed by Roland Joffé and stars Demi Moore, Gary Oldman, and Robert Duvall.\nPage: Gary Oldman. Sentence: Gary Leonard Oldman (born 21 March 1958) is an English actor, filmmaker, musician and author who has performed in theatre, film and television.\nPage: Cinergi Pictures. Sentence: A string of box office bombs - including \"Color of Night\", \"Judge Dredd\", \"The Scarlet Letter\", \"Nixon\", \"Shadow Conspiracy\", \"Deep Rising\" and \"\" - ultimately undid the company, and it closed in 1998.\nPage: Brat Pack (actors). Sentence: The \"core\" members are considered to be Emilio Estevez, Anthony Michael Hall, Rob Lowe, Andrew McCarthy, Demi Moore, Judd Nelson, Molly Ringwald, and Ally Sheedy.",
