        "original_id": "868215d9-a8cc-5f74-a1db-9333556f211c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Scarlet Letter (1995 film)\n- People: Roland Joffé, Demi Moore, Gary Oldman, Robert Duvall, Gary Leonard Oldman, Emilio Estevez, Anthony Michael Hall, Rob Lowe, Andrew McCarthy, Judd Nelson, Molly Ringwald, Ally Sheedy\n- Companies: Cinergi Pictures\n- Organizations: Brat Pack\n- Topics: American romantic drama films, box office bombs\n\nFacts:\n- Gary Leonard Oldman was born on 21 March 1958.\n- Gary Leonard Oldman is an English actor, filmmaker, musician, and author who has worked in theatre, film, and television.\n- The Scarlet Letter is a 1995 American romantic drama film.\n- The Scarlet Letter was directed by Roland Joffé and stars Demi Moore, Gary Oldman, and Robert Duvall.\n- Demi Moore is considered one of the core members of the Brat Pack, alongside Emilio Estevez, Anthony Michael Hall, Rob Lowe, Andrew McCarthy, Judd Nelson, Molly Ringwald, and Ally Sheedy.\n- Cinergi Pictures suffered a string of box office bombs that included The Scarlet Letter, and the company closed in 1998.",
